      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Sep-10-2013 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled this day for OSC hearing for Name Change.<br>Dept. 514, Judge: Paul Alvarado, Clerk: S. Vantree, CSR: Sonia Wong, #11288.<br>Petitioner Xiao Xia Zhen mother of minor present in court. <br>Petitioner sworn and examined.<br>Baoyu Huang sworn and acts as Cantonese interpreter for petitoner.<br>Proof of Publication on file.<br>Proof of Service to other parent.<br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct and sufficient, and that the petition should be granted.<br>The court grants the petition for Change of Name of minor from Yuexin Chen to Serena Chen<br>Decree Changing Name signed in open court.",
